	SantaClaus: Find Santa in the Snow biome and speak to him.
	Steampunker: The Steampunker is hiding in the Dungeon. Speak to her when you find her.
	TaxCollector: A Tortured Soul wanders the Underworld. Cure it with Purification Powder.
	Default: Find and rescue this resident. No boss defeat is required for the encounter.
